          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does shipping cost?",
            "answer": "<p>Standard shipping is free within the United States. Paid express shipping affects carrier transit only and does not shorten the processing period. International customers pay the carrier-calculated shipping rate shown at checkout. International orders are shipped DAP, and the customer is responsible for duties, taxes, brokerage fees, and other import charges collected by the destination country or carrier.</p>",
